{"id":21716,"name":"Turvei B1","category":"hike","country":"NO","generated_at":"2026-08-14T13:49:44+00:00","description_md":"Turvei B1 is a 13.2 km walking route located in Norway. The route involves 139 m of ascent and 224 m of descent, with a walking time of about 3.8 hours on the DIN 33466 hiking time rule.\n\nThe difficulty is moderate, derived from distance and ascent. It is signposted as B1 within a local waymarked hiking network, and the line matches the official route published by turrutebasen. The route passes the Fram Museum and Polar Ship Fram within 100 m, as well as the Viking Ship Museum within 200 m.","distance_m":13242,"ascent_m":139,"descent_m":224,"duration_min":226,"difficulty":"moderate","sac_scale":null,"network":"lwn","bbox":[10.675009,59.895087,10.717251,59.958216],"geometry":{"type":"MultiLineString","coordinates":[[[10.687037,59.90745,18.9],[10.687118,59.907477,18.9],[10.687204,59.907499,19],[10.687166,59.907517,19],[10.687152,59.907524,19],[10.687111,59.907519,19.1],[10.687064,59.907518,19.1],[10.687002,59.907529,19.1],[10.686949,59.907549,19.2],[10.686376,59.907815,21.6],[10.686282,59.90786,22.4],[10.686284,59.907897,22.9],[10.686261,59.907944,23.4],[10.686112,59.908096,24],[10.686096,59.908158,24],[10.686143,59.908204,24.1],[10.6862,59.908265,24.4],[10.686347,59.908353,25],[10.686608,59.908469,25.5],[10.686851,59.908536,25.5],[10.6871,59.908574,26],[10.687441,59.908644,27.2],[10.68783,59.9087,27],[10.688184,59.908805,25.7],[10.688741,59.908963,24.3],[10.689238,59.909098,24.1],[10.689448,59.909174,24],[10.689626,59.909269,24],[10.689678,59.909348,24],[10.689667,59.909431,23.4],[10.68964,59.909595,22.2],[10.68962,59.909855,20.3],[10.689652,59.910314,17.4],[10.689701,59.910485,16.5],[10.689717,59.910823,16],[10.689716,59.910974,16.4],[10.689781,59.911345,16.7],[10.689712,59.911545,17.1],[10.689645,59.911753,18.9],[10.689603,59.911926,22],[10.689589,59.911986,23.1],[10.689453,59.912172,22.1],[10.689397,59.912199,21.6],[10.688638,59.912538,23.